{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"catapult_fixed","model_identifier":"catapult_fixed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# catapult_fixed\n\nFixed catapult for the Citadel's engine platform (Patch 5): the catapult on a short, heavy timber base frame with ground sleepers, a plan cross-brace, iron straps and bolts, no wheels and no tow tongue; the throwing arm is shortened to fit the platform. It is built from `catapult` and keeps its bones and clips except the wheels; it cannot move.\n\n- Placement: its origin sits on the Citadel's `slot_engine`, facing -Z; its crewmen stand at `slot_crew_1` and `slot_crew_2`.\n- Bounds: x -20..20, y 0..52, z -33..26 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 59.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `idle` (4 s, loop)\n- `fire` (2.2 s)\n- `reload` (4 s)\n- `damaged` (0.7 s)\n- `destroyed` (2 s)\n\n(`move` and `move_towed` are removed: a fixed engine never moves.)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_crew_1` at (16, 0, 28)\n- `slot_crew_2` at (-16, 0, 28)"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"beam_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[11.5,9.5,-31],"to":[16.5,16,25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,-36],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[216,78,221,85],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[110,69,166,76],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[221,78,226,85],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[166,69,222,76],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[40,0,45,56],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[45,0,50,56],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e9c66afe-f2e7-52e5-912d-e7d34f90abe1"},{"name":"team_stripe_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[16.4,12,-25],"to":[16.7,13.5,19],"autouv":0,"color":0,