,{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"68.6","y":"0","z":"5.88"}],"uuid":"bee7b3d9-357a-5dff-af6e-0682a908f54e","time":1.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"70","y":"0","z":"6"}],"uuid":"1e31e05c-1b7a-5ddc-8c78-d4de6c94d491","time":1.35,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"70","y":"0","z":"6"}],"uuid":"376e6790-1aa4-5f55-8c89-9b5d517e5902","time":2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]},"346a4f0c-2df8-5cbe-a945-bb4a8e6543a9":{"name":"arm","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false,"keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"cc35be5b-59bf-591a-9048-669baad6bdc5","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"1.878","y":"-4","z":"0"}],"uuid":"7152567b-dfd4-50a6-b82b-268c0c78e11f","time":0.3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"16.902","y":"-36","z":"0"}],"uuid":"0d2c7d8e-3e28-5f6f-874f-beac5d4b12d2","time":0.7,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"19.719","y":"-40","z":"0"}],"uuid":"a3733ed0-c879-57fc-9caa-dc86a90b6ba7","time":0.85,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"18.78","y":"-40","z":"0"}],"uuid":"e97aeaa4-0148-5f2d-a88d-acee8b956fb5","time":1,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"18.78","y":"-40","z":"0"}],"uuid":"34a12a0a-5b37-5d8d-986f-ef38ba522423","time":2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# catapult_fixed\n\nFixed catapult for the Citadel's engine platform (Patch 5): the catapult on a short, heavy timber base frame with ground sleepers, a plan cross-brace, iron straps and bolts, no wheels and no tow tongue; the throwing arm is shortened to fit the platform. It is built from `catapult` and keeps its bones and clips except the wheels; it cannot move.\n\n- Placement: its origin sits on the Citadel's `slot_engine`, facing -Z; its crewmen stand at `slot_crew_1` and `slot_crew_2`.\n- Bounds: x -20..20, y 0..52, z -33..26 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 59.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `idle` (4 s, loop)\n- `fire` (2.2 s)\n- `reload` (4 s)\n- `damaged` (0.7 s)\n- `destroyed` (2 s)\n\n(`move` and `move_towed` are removed: a fixed engine never moves.)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_crew_1` at (16, 0, 28)\n- `slot_crew_2` at (-16, 0, 28)"}